Behavioral and interface references (no source code copied):
- recipe-lab-sony-pmca (GPL-3.0), local reference checkout: the Activity + SurfaceView + Canvas structure,
  Camera.Parameters keys and Sony scan codes known to work on the NEX-6.
- sony-lut-camera (GPL-3.0), local reference checkout: the static firmware audit showing that the NEX-6
  lacks CameraEx RGB-matrix and extended-gamma APIs.
- sony-nex6-app-menu-unlock: the separate procedure that restores the NEX-6 app-menu entry.
These projects' licenses do not cover this repository, and none of their source is included here.

No Sony firmware, Sony base-application code, official Fujifilm LUT file, Fujifilm-fitted parameter table,
Ricoh matrix/gamma array, camera signing key or unlock device data is included in this repository.
